# Compiled Binaries & Release Archives
*.apk
*.exe
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.7z

# Backup Folders
*_backup*/
*.bak
*.bak*

# Flutter / Dart Build Caches
**/build/
**/.dart_tool/
**/.flutter-plugins-dependencies
**/windows/flutter/ephemeral/
**/linux/flutter/ephemeral/
**/macos/Flutter/ephemeral/

# Python Caches
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo

# IDE & Editor files
**/.idea/
**/.vscode/
*.iml

# Logs
*.log

# Node & Frontend Build Caches
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/dist-ssr/

# Secrets & Environment Files (Strictly excluded)
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.env.local
!**/.env.example


